      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #d7dfd3;border-radius:var(--radius,7px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#27352e);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;background:var(--green,#335b43);color:#fff;border-color:var(--green,#335b43);}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:#284a36;border-color:#b6c4b2;}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.46;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Implemented secondary button control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-secondary\">Add sources</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #d7dfd3;border-radius:var(--radius,7px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#27352e);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;}.ds-button-secondary:hover{background:#f0f3eb;border-color:#b6c4b2;}.ds-button-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-secondary:disabled{opacity:.46;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-secondary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Implemented text button control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-text\">Explore the accepted model</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-text{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #d7dfd3;border-radius:var(--radius,7px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#27352e);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;border:0;background:transparent;padding:5px 0;min-height:32px;justify-content:flex-start;color:var(--green,#335b43);white-space:normal;text-align:left;}.ds-button-text:hover{background:transparent;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;}.ds-button-text:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-text:disabled{opacity:.46;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-text{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "Named compact action, shown as the inspector close control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-icon\" aria-label=\"Close inspector\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #d7dfd3;border-radius:var(--radius,7px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#27352e);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;padding:7px;width:32px;min-height:32px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#667168);flex:none;}.ds-button-icon:hover{background:#f0f3eb;}.ds-button-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Labeled field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Stacked label with a standard text input.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>Name</span><input aria-label=\"Name\" placeholder=\"Name\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;min-width:0;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-size:12px;}.ds-field>span{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:#5d7152;}.ds-field input{font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;width:100%;min-width:0;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid #d5ddd1;border-radius:5px;padding:9px 10px;color:var(--ink,#27352e);caret-color:var(--green,#335b43);}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:#64705f;}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Current-page row on the deep navigation ground.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Workspace navigation\"><button aria-current=\"page\">Sources</button><button>Model</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:var(--nav,#202c28);padding:15px;}.ds-nav button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #d7dfd3;border-radius:var(--radius,7px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#27352e);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#adbbae;justify-content:flex-start;gap:12px;min-height:41px;padding:11px 13px;font-weight:400;}.ds-nav button:hover,.ds-nav button[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:#344634;color:#eef6dd;}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-neutral",
      "description": "Non-interactive neutral, ready, pending, and failed state labels.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-badges\"><span class=\"ds-badge\">internal</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-green\">ready</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-amber\">pending</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-red\">failed</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-badges{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;}.ds-badge{font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:3px 7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;border-radius:4px;color:#5c655e;background:#eef0eb;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-green{color:#3b6140;background:#eaf1e5;}.ds-amber{color:#8a5c20;background:#f8eed9;}.ds-red{color:#9b4436;background:#fae9e3;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence passage",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "evidence-passage",
      "description": "Inset source passage with locator and preserved line breaks.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-evidence\"><span class=\"ds-locator\">Source locator</span><p>Source passage</p><small>Evidence identity</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-evidence{font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:13px 0 20px;padding:14px;background:#f7f9f2;border:1px solid #e7ecdf;border-radius:5px;}.ds-locator,.ds-evidence small{font-size:10px;color:#637257;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-evidence p{font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.8;color:#50613f;margin:8px 0;}.ds-evidence small{display:block;margin-top:8px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Proposal detail",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "proposal-detail",
      "description": "White review panel with title and supporting summary.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-proposal\"><div class=\"ds-proposal-heading\"><h2>Proposal review</h2></div><p>Review the proposed changes and their evidence.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-proposal{font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;background:var(--surface,#fff);padding:27px;border:1px solid #dfe7d5;border-radius:8px;}.ds-proposal-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;}.ds-proposal h2{font-family:var(--font-heading,\"DM Sans\",sans-serif);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-size:23px;line-height:1.4;margin:13px 0 0;}.ds-proposal>p{font-size:12px;color:#637257;line-height:1.9;margin:15px 0 20px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-proposal{padding:20px 16px;}.ds-proposal h2{font-size:21px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source ledger",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "ledger-row",
      "description": "Source-name action with subordinate metadata, authority, and status.",
      "html": "<table class=\"ds-ledger\"><thead><tr><th>Source</th><th>Authority</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><button><span><strong>glossary.md</strong><small>public \u00b7 Version 1</small></span></button></td><td><span class=\"ds-authority\">supporting</span></td><td><span class=\"ds-ready\">ready</span></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "css": ".ds-ledger{font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;text-align:left;}.ds-ledger th{font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#64735a;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dfe4db);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dfe4db);padding:12px 10px;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-ledger td{padding:17px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e8df;vertical-align:middle;line-height:1.45;}.ds-ledger th:first-child,.ds-ledger td:first-child{padding-left:0;}.ds-ledger th:last-child,.ds-ledger td:last-child{padding-right:0;}.ds-ledger tr:hover td{background:#f2f5ee;}.ds-ledger button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #d7dfd3;border-radius:var(--radius,7px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#27352e);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;border:0;background:transparent;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left;padding:0;gap:12px;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;min-width:190px;}.ds-ledger button:hover{background:transparent;}.ds-ledger button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #507449;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-ledger strong{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:block;}.ds-ledger small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#637257;margin-top:5px;}.ds-authority{font-size:11px;color:#637257;}.ds-ready{display:inline-flex;padding:3px 7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;border-radius:4px;color:#3b6140;background:#eaf1e5;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-ledger strong{font-size:12px;max-width:148px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-ledger small,.ds-authority,.ds-ledger th,.ds-ready{font-size:10px;}.ds-ledger button{min-width:170px;}.ds-ledger td{padding:16px 3px;}.ds-ledger td:first-child{padding-left:0;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Engineering change-control ledger",
    "overview": "Tracework feels like a working technical review desk: warm paper, deep ink navigation, compact editorial tables, and quiet mineral colors. Stable rows and fine rules give source evidence, proposed changes, and accepted meaning a common visual language. The interface is dense enough for desk work while keeping names, state, and authority distinguishable.\n\nTypography and state carry the identity. Flat surfaces keep evidence readable; contextual panels expose detail without turning each object into a decorative card. The established material is code-led, with consistent Lucide strokes and no decorative raster imagery.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm paper and deep green-black navigation.",
      "Compact tables with explicit state text and field-level evidence links.",
      "DM Sans headings, IBM Plex Sans interface text, and monospace for exact identities.",
      "Flat resting surfaces; shadows mark transient layers."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Explicit State Rule",
        "body": "State labels remain visible alongside mineral green, amber, and muted red; color reinforces the decision rather than carrying it alone.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do pair state color with readable state text.",
      "Do retain the final readable metadata sizes and muted-text treatment when extending tables.",
      "Do use the shared focus outline on interactive controls and give icon-only actions an accessible name.",
      "Do preserve the linear inspector handoff on narrow screens and restore focus when it closes.",
      "Do keep exact hashes and code in monospace and allow long identities and locators to wrap."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace the ledger with a marketing dashboard or decorative raster composition.",
      "Don't add shadows to ordinary evidence, proposal, or table surfaces.",
      "Don't use color alone to distinguish accepted state, pending review, or failure.",
      "Don't hide source authority or status when reducing the source table for mobile."
    ]
  }
}
